MAIN
MOVE TEMP 10 4
MOVE TEMP 11 HALLOCATE TEMP 10
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 12 4
MOVE TEMP 13 HALLOCATE TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 14 A_check
HSTORE TEMP 6 0 TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 15 TEMP 6
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 5
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 0
MOVE TEMP 16 CALL TEMP 8 ( TEMP 4 )
PRINT TEMP 16
END
A_check [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 17 5
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 10
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 19 DIV TEMP 2 TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 20 2
MOVE TEMP 21 NE TEMP 3 TEMP 20
CJUMP TEMP 21 L0
MOVE TEMP 22 DIV TEMP 2 TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 22
JUMP L1
L0 MOVE TEMP 23 0
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 24 LE TEMP 1 TEMP 2
CJUMP TEMP 24 L2
MOVE TEMP 25 2
MOVE TEMP 26 NE TEMP 3 TEMP 25
CJUMP TEMP 26 L2
MOVE TEMP 27 1
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 27
L2  NOOP
CJUMP TEMP 9 L3
MOVE TEMP 28 DIV TEMP 2 TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 28
JUMP L4
L3 MOVE TEMP 29 999999
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 29
L4  NOOP
L1  NOOP
PRINT TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 30 10
MOVE TEMP 31 PLUS TEMP 3 TEMP 30
MOVE TEMP 32 10
MOVE TEMP 33 PLUS TEMP 31 TEMP 32

RETURN TEMP 33
END

